    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14541" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπρο-φύλακτος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not guarded
				against, unforeseen,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.55
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					38.41
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ach.Tat.
				8.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unguarded,</i>
