				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				5.106
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>using no precautions,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				6.13
			</span></i>.</div>
